OL,3,GNEWSAFeasibility funding for Pennine
OL,4,Atunnel scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group wanting to build a #2bn
OL,7,Funderground tunnel linking Sheffield
OL,8,Fand Manchester through the Peak
OL,9,FDistrict have been handed a #500,000
OL,10,Fboost to kickstart the project.
OL,12,FTrans-Pennine Connect have campaigned
OL,13,Ffor years for better connectivity
OL,14,Fbetween the cities and have now been
OL,15,Fgiven a grant towards a feasibility
OL,16,Fstudy.
OL,18,FThe plan is to build a new 14-mile
OL,19,F(22km) road tunnel from Langset near
OL,20,FStocksbridge to Tintwistle in
OL,21,FDerbyshire, as well as restore the
OL,22,Fhistoric Woodhead railway line.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
