OL,3,GNEWSAFeasibility funding for Pennine
OL,4,Atunnel scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe money came from the UK Dynamism
OL,7,FFund, and its CEO Andrew Bennett said:
OL,8,F"It is one of the most ambitious
OL,9,Fschemes anywhere in the UK and it is
OL,10,Fvery easy for us to support them."
